{"id":"a98a52788e","t":"The Abandoned Princess Monopolizes the Grand Duke’s Favor","c":"cv","n":33,"l":33,"s":["ml","az"],"k":{"ml":"the-abandoned-princess-monopolizes-the-grand-dukes-favor","az":"the-abandoned-princess-monopolizes-the-grand-duke's-favor"},"u":1795077124897,"desc":"سيرافينا، أميرة مملكة إميلاد، تلقى حتفًا بائسًا، بعد أن تخلى عنها من وثقت بهم إثر اتهامها زورًا. وعندما فتحت عينيها، عادت إلى لحظة مأساوية في الماضي. وعازمة على عدم تكرار الفشل نفسه، قررت التقرب من الدوق الأكبر، المعروف باسم “وحش الدم”. ومن خلال احتكار حظوة ريانيد، الدوق الأكبر البارد للشمال، اتخذت موقفًا مُرضيًا ضد القدر والعالم اللذين تخليّا عنها في هذه الرواية الرومانسية الخيالية","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["انتقام","خيالي","رومانسى"],"src":{"ml":"the-abandoned-princess-monopolizes-the-grand-dukes-favor","az":"the-abandoned-princess-monopolizes-the-grand-duke's-favor"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-abandoned-princess-monopolizes-the-grand-dukes-favor|/manga/the-abandoned-princess-monopolizes-the-grand-dukes-favor/1/","az":"the-abandoned-princess-monopolizes-the-grand-duke's-favor|/series/the-abandoned-princess-monopolizes-the-grand-duke's-favor/chapter-1"},"2":{"ml":"the-abandoned-princess-monopolizes-the-grand-dukes-favor|/manga/the-abandoned-princess-monopolizes-the-grand-dukes-favor/2/"},"3":{"ml":"the-abandoned-princess-monopolizes-the-grand-dukes-favor|/manga/the-abandoned-princess-monopolizes-the-grand-dukes-favor/3/"},"4":{"ml":"the-abandoned-princess-monopolizes-the-grand-dukes-favor|/manga/the-abandoned-princess-monopolizes-the-grand-dukes-favor/4/"},"5":{"ml":"the-abandoned-princess-monopolizes-the-grand-dukes-favor|/manga/the-abandoned-princess-monopolizes-the-grand-dukes-favor/5/"},"6":{"ml":"the-abandoned-princess-monopolizes-the-grand-dukes-favor|/manga/the-abandoned-princess-monopolizes-the-grand-dukes-favor/6/"},"7":{"ml":"the-abandoned-princess-monopolizes-the-grand-dukes-favor|/manga/the-abandoned-princess-monopolizes-the-grand-dukes-favor/7/"},"8":{"ml":"the